// Which moves each Pokémon can learn, keyed by national dex id. "move"
// strings reference data/moves.js keys.
//
// 1: {
//   levelUp: [{ level: 1, move: "Tackle" }],
//   tm: ["Toxic"],
//   egg: ["Skull Bash"],
//   tutor: [],
//   max: []
// }
//
// "tutor" (0.2.5) is pokemon_moves.csv method 3, taken from the SAME version
// group already chosen for levelUp/tm/egg — tutor rows deliberately don't
// take part in choosing that version group, so adding them couldn't shift
// any existing list. Almost always empty: only Wormadam (#413) has tutor
// rows in its selected game. No UI reads it (the Learnable Moves card's tab
// list is fixed at Level-Up/TM/Egg/Max).
//
// A levelUp entry may carry an optional "mastery" (0.2.5) — Legends: Arceus's
// move-mastery level, from that CSV's `mastery` column. Present only for the
// 54 species whose newest usable version group is legends-arceus, and only on
// level-up rows; absent everywhere else by design, not by omission.
//
// "max" (Max Moves) is left empty for every entry -- Dynamax was a Gen 8
// mechanic removed in Gen 9, so there is no current-gen data for it.
// levelUp/tm/egg use the most recent game version that has real data for
// that Pokémon (noted per-entry in HISTORY.md where it isn't Gen 9 itself).

